# Turning or moving a Stock Exchange (the relocate tool, Move It) keeps its building number, so
# the live boards must follow it at once, not stay on the old side until the next building scan.
name the ticker boards follow a Stock Exchange that is turned
live-ticker on
wait 6
expect-ticker-on-building
turn-exchange 90
wait 1
expect-ticker-on-building
turn-exchange restore
wait 1
expect-ticker-on-building
cleanup:
turn-exchange restore
